flex items-start gap-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-text dark:text-white/80\"><span class=\"text-brand-muted dark:text-white/40 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">→</span>Hundreds of templates</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-text dark:text-white/80\"><span class=\"text-brand-muted dark:text-white/40 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">→</span>Brand voice training</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-text dark:text-white/80\"><span class=\"text-brand-muted dark:text-white/40 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\">→</span>Excellent for long-form content</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-brand-warm-gray dark:bg-[#111110] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-brand-border dark:border-white/5 mb-12\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-bold text-xl text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-3\">Our verdict</h2><p class=\"font-body text-base text-brand-muted dark:text-white/60 leading-relaxed\">Jasper is a powerful writing tool you operate. Nebulaa is an autonomous agent that operates itself. If you want AI to do the work without your input every day, Nebulaa is built for that.</p></div><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"font-heading font-bold text-2xl text-brand-text dark:text-white mb-4\">Ready to try Nebulaa?</p><p class=\"font-body text-base text-brand-muted dark:text-white/60 mb-6\">7-day free trial. No credit card required.</p><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-brand-gold text-brand-black font-body font-semibold rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all hover:scale-[1.03]\">Start free trial →</a></div></div></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"><